  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ましろ",
    "text": "「ねぇね、いまヒマっ？　よぉしよし、良い子だぁ〜っ☆　ぎゅうう〜♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 24,
    "dress": "old-swim2",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-swim2_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ましろ",
    "text": "「うわぁん、ほんとは寂しかったんだよぉ〜！　私、自分に嘘ついてた！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ましろ",
    "text": "「ひとりぼっちは嫌だよぉお、でもみんな『日滝さんと一緒にいると、暑苦しい』」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 24,
    "dress": "old-swim2",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-swim2_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ましろ",
    "text": "「『夏休みはちょっと、距離を置こう？』って誰も遊んでくれないんだよぉおおう！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 24,
    "dress": "old-swim2",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-swim2_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ましろ",
    "text": "「転校生くんがいてくれてよかったよぉ〜、むっちゅ♪　むぅっちゅ♪（キス音）」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ましろ",
    "text": "「……でも実際、どうして海にいるのだ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ましろ",
    "text": "「まぁ学校の近所だし、夏だしな！　自然と足が海に向かってしまうのも当然だろう！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
